    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>first maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>0, second maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>2.5 and third maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>5 s ✔<br/>maxima must touch the other curve and minima the time axis ✔  Allow [1] for half the cycle drawn over the 5 seconds</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.i\"><p><strong>a.i</strong></p><p>«Q<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{10}{5}\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>» 4<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"≈\"></span> 13 ✔</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a.ii\"><p><strong>a.ii</strong></p><p>first maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>0, second maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>2.5 and third maximum at t<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\"></span>5 s ✔<br/>maxima must touch the other curve and minima the time axis ✔  Allow [1] for half the cycle drawn over the 5 seconds</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_02\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 2\" src=\"asset:fig_02\"/></figure></p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>because structures will develop large amplitudes / close to the natural frequency ✔<br/>these can lead to collapse of the structure ✔</p></section>"
